<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 4,560 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 133.52 pence a kilo against 126.75 last week and 112.34 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 51,472 pkgs sold so far this year is 120.21 pence against 113.67 pence for the 60,974 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
</text>
